/* 2026-10-29 (BELT): the margin the colour rule actually used on this frame (it is no
 * longer the compile-time PART_MARGIN -- it scales with the frame's own green level), and
 * the chromaticity of the mask it produced.  Both are published so a host can see WHY a
 * count is what it is instead of inferring it from the count. */
/* (the declaration moved into view_state_t, see VIEW_STATE_BASE) */
