/* PROBLEM 2 (2026-10-25): the live mask's box and the "fully in view" answer.  Computed
 * by part_bbox_publish() from LIVE_MASK right after each live part_masks() pass, so the
 * box and MB_PART_PTS always describe the same mask.  0xFFFFFFFF means "no cell" (an empty
 * mask), which is how the box words distinguish "no part" from "a part in the corner". */
/* (the declaration moved into view_state_t, see VIEW_STATE_BASE) */
/* (the declaration moved into view_state_t, see VIEW_STATE_BASE) */
/* (the declaration moved into view_state_t, see VIEW_STATE_BASE) */
